@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8088
@model = qwen2.5:1.5b
@conversationId = conv-demo-01
@jobId = replace-with-job-id

### 1. Healthcheck Gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### 2. User Chat - HTTP REST Dong bo (Non-Streaming JSON)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user-01",
  "conversation_id": "{{conversationId}}",
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "prompt": "Giai thich ngan gon Go goroutine trong 2 cau"
}

### 3. User Chat - HTTP SSE Streaming (Real-time)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user-01",
  "conversation_id": "{{conversationId}}",
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "prompt": "Viet 1 ham hello world bang Go"
}

### 4. Lay lich su hoi thoai theo Conversation ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/{{conversationId}}/history

### 5. Huy job dang chay (Stop Generation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/{{jobId}}/stop

### 6. Admin - Xem danh sach Worker Node dang online (CPU, RAM, ActiveJobs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/nodes

### 7. Admin - Xem do dai hang doi Redis Stream theo model
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/queues?models=qwen2.5:1.5b,qwen2.5:7b,llama3.2:3b

### 8. Internal HTTP - Day luong NDJSON token (thay the gRPC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/tokens/stream
Content-Type: application/x-ndjson

{"job_id":"{{jobId}}","worker_id":"http-worker-01","token":"Hello ","done":false}
{"job_id":"{{jobId}}","worker_id":"http-worker-01","token":"World","done":true}

### 9. Internal HTTP - Day 1 token don le
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/v1/tokens/push
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "job_id": "{{jobId}}",
  "worker_id": "http-worker-01",
  "token": "ping",
  "done": true
}

